{"id":"wb-6-457","name":"代县文庙","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"代县文庙","text":"代县文庙是明、清山西代州的州学文庙，现在位于山西省忻州市代县上馆镇西南街村，即城内西南部的西南街。现存建筑主要建于明代，规模宏大，为华北现存最大的州文庙。已列为全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E4%BB%A3%E5%8E%BF%E6%96%87%E5%BA%99","revisionId":93974793,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93974793","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/d86e0eff895a880490a957e9.jpg","title":"Dacheng_Hall_of_Daixian_Confucian_Temple_(20250713100717).jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Dacheng_Hall_of_Daixian_Confucian_Temple_(20250713100717).jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/06/Dacheng_Hall_of_Daixian_Confucian_Temple_%2820250713100717%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"N509FZ","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"The whole temple has a CNY 28 entrance fee.","width":320,"height":213}}